@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1
@studentToken = replace-with-demo-login-access-token
@adminToken = replace-with-admin-demo-login-access-token
@managerToken = replace-with-manager-demo-login-access-token
@resourceId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000101
@requirementId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@submissionId = replace-with-created-submission-id
@bookingId = replace-with-created-booking-id
@bookingStart = 2026-10-07T09:00:00+11:00
@bookingEnd = 2026-10-07T10:00:00+11:00
@rescheduledStart = 2026-10-08T13:00:00+11:00
@rescheduledEnd = 2026-10-08T14:00:00+11:00

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/

### Authentication configuration
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/config/

### Demo login: a student with valid qualification
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/demo-login/
Content-Type: application/json

{"zid": "z1000001"}

### Demo login: student who needs to submit induction (cannot book until an admin verifies it: 403 QUALIFICATION_REQUIRED)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/demo-login/
Content-Type: application/json

{"zid": "z1000002"}

### Demo registration: always creates a student
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/demo-register/
Content-Type: application/json

{"zid": "z1234567", "display_name": "Demo Student", "university_email": "z1234567@ad.unsw.edu.au"}

### Current student
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me/
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Find rooms
GET {{baseUrl}}/resources/?kind=ROOM
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Find individual equipment
GET {{baseUrl}}/resources/?kind=EQUIPMENT
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Qualification requirements
GET {{baseUrl}}/qualification-requirements/
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Submit induction. Replace the sample file path with a real PDF/PNG/JPEG.
POST {{baseUrl}}/qualifications/
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=demo-boundary

--demo-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="requirement_id"

{{requirementId}}
--demo-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Induction completion certificate
--demo-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="notes"

Please review my induction certificate.
--demo-boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="certificate.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./certificate.pdf
--demo-boundary--

### Availability. Use a future date within the configured opening hours.
GET {{baseUrl}}/resources/{{resourceId}}/availability/?date=2026-10-07&duration_minutes=60
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Create a booking. Needs a verified induction. Start must be 7 to 30 days from today (MIN/MAX_ADVANCE_DAYS); update timestamps before replaying.
### Result is PENDING_APPROVAL (an admin decides within 24 hours, otherwise the system approves if the rules still hold) or WAITLISTED if the time is taken.
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-booking-request-001

{
  "resource_id": "{{resourceId}}",
  "start": "{{bookingStart}}",
  "end": "{{bookingEnd}}",
  "purpose": "Project laboratory session"
}

### Student dashboard. Only APPROVED means a confirmed booking.
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Demo administrator login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/demo-login/
Content-Type: application/json

{"zid": "z9000001"}

### Pending induction submissions
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/qualifications/?status=PENDING
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Read a private attachment
GET {{baseUrl}}/qualifications/{{submissionId}}/file/
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Verify induction. The server sets valid_until (QUALIFICATION_VALIDITY_DAYS, default 120); do not send it.
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/qualifications/{{submissionId}}/review/
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"decision": "VERIFIED", "reason": "Certificate checked"}

### Reject induction
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/qualifications/{{submissionId}}/review/
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"decision": "REJECTED", "reason": "Please provide the required induction certificate"}

### Pending booking approvals (each shows review_due_at; an admin cannot approve their own request)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/bookings/?status=PENDING_APPROVAL
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Waitlisted requests (move up to pending in submission order when time frees up; can only be rejected)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/bookings/?status=WAITLISTED
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Approve booking. Requires valid induction and no approved/pending-request conflict.
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/bookings/{{bookingId}}/review/
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"decision": "APPROVED", "reason": "Request reviewed"}

### Reject booking
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/bookings/{{bookingId}}/review/
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"decision": "REJECTED", "reason": "Please choose another time slot"}

### Process due requests. Uses server time; clients cannot fast-forward time. Decides pending requests whose review window has ended and expires requests that reached their start.
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/process-due/
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Reschedule an approved future booking
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}/reschedule/
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"start": "{{rescheduledStart}}", "end": "{{rescheduledEnd}}"}

### Cancel own booking
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings/{{bookingId}}/cancel/
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Full audit history of one booking (Admin or Manager), newest first
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/audit/?entity_id={{bookingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Audit trail for one resource, e.g. all cancellations
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/audit/?resource_id={{resourceId}}&action=BOOKING_CANCELLED&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### OpenAPI JSON
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/schema/

### Demo manager login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/demo-login/
Content-Type: application/json

{"zid": "z9000002"}

### Staff and user list with each person's induction status (Manager only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### Move a student to ADMIN (or back to STUDENT), or deactivate an account (Manager only; not yourself).
### A student needs every induction verified first; this demo student has none, so expect 409 INDUCTION_REQUIRED_FOR_ADMIN.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000502/
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"role": "ADMIN"}

### Read a resource's review window (Admin or Manager)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/resources/{{resourceId}}/booking-policy/
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### Set the admin review window in minutes (Manager only; default 1440 = 24 hours; existing deadlines stay unchanged)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/resources/{{resourceId}}/booking-policy/
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"pending_hold_minutes": 1440}

### Outlook configuration and sync records (credentials are never returned)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/outlook/
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Process one due Outlook job
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/outlook/process/
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"limit": 1}

### Retry after updating the local Microsoft Graph token
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/bookings/{{bookingId}}/outlook-retry/
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### All bookings with student and resource names (Admin or Manager)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/bookings/?status=ALL&resource_id={{resourceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### Export bookings as CSV (Manager only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/bookings/export/?status=APPROVED
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### Put a room under maintenance (Manager only; existing bookings are kept and listed)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/resources/{{resourceId}}/status/
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "MAINTENANCE", "reason": "Fume hood repair"}

### Reopen the room
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/resources/{{resourceId}}/status/
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"status": "AVAILABLE"}

### Add manager: the only way to create a Manager (Manager only; creates a new account)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/managers/
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"zid": "z5123456", "display_name": "New Lab Manager", "university_email": "z5123456@ad.unsw.edu.au"}
